  "notes": "Fixed semi-annual Act/365F vs 3M BKBM quarterly. T+2 (2026-07-08 probe settled Jul-13 across the Matariki holiday). OIS = OCR-linked overnight. FRA strip added 2026-07 (composite-only full securities) to shape the front end between swap pillars; FRAs whose maturity clashes with a quoted pillar are skipped by the bootstrapper. Forward reference switched S0484,S0485 -> NDFS year-pair securities 2026-07-29: NDFS0505 BLC = 4.7858 against our 4.7858 (exact), where the S0484/S0485 average sat -1.4bp out and tilted to -6.0bp by 20y10y; auditfwd went from 7 flags to 0. The BLC qualifier is REQUIRED - plain and BGN forms resolve by name with no price and no history at all. Field order is start-then-tenor despite Bloomberg naming them \"5YX1Y\" (verified against the Forward Curve Matrix). Grid is the sparse {1-10,12,15,20,25,30} - NDFS1103 does not exist - and it goes flat past 25y, so 15y15y and 20y10y now read \"no FWCM\" in auditfwd rather than a fake error."
